Package: lume
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, ddcutil
Description: Minimalist brightness control utility
 Lume is a minimalist brightness control utility focused on the
 "open, adjust the slider, and close" philosophy. Compatible with
 external monitors via DDC/CI and laptop screens via sysfs.
